msgid ""
msgstr "性能优化指南"

msgid "NPU高性能编程指南"
msgstr "NPU High-Performance Programming Guide"

msgid "合并Grid分核"
msgstr "Merging Grid split cores"

msgid "一、自动合并Grid分核优化原则"
msgstr "1\\. Principles for Optimizing Automatic Grid Merging and Core Splitting"

msgid "部分场景下，Triton算子从GPU迁移到NPU。由于体系结构的差异，基于GPU开发的Triton算子Grid分核数较多。在NPU上执行时，无法一次全部调度，多轮下发导致下发时延过大，影响算子性能。基于NPU优化Triton算子过程中，需要首先检查Grid分核数。当分核数较大时，使用TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL环境变量提升算子执行性能。"
msgstr "In some scenarios, Triton operators are migrated from GPU to NPU. Due to architectural differences, Triton operators developed on GPU have a relatively large number of Grid blocks. When executed on NPU, they cannot all be scheduled at once, and multiple rounds of dispatch lead to excessive dispatch latency, affecting operator performance. During the process of optimizing Triton operators on NPU, it is necessary to first check the number of Grid blocks. When the number of blocks is large, use the TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL environment variable to improve operator execution performance."

msgid "指令并行优化"
msgstr "Instruction-level parallelism optimization"

msgid "一、指令并行优化核心原则"
msgstr "Core Principles of Instruction-Level Parallelism Optimization"

msgid "Triton算子在NPU上执行时，为了提升性能，NPU底层提供multi buffer、指令并行等并行机制，将“数据搬入/数据计算/数据搬出”并行起来，以此来提升性能；但是某些场景下存在multi buffer无法使能问题，影响并行度，导致算子执行性能降低；在性能优化过程中，存在此类问题时，可以参考以下几点做排查，并按照代码示例优化： 1、数据搬运和计算存在数据依赖，产生同步，必须依赖Vector运算后，才能触发MTE搬运，导致并行度低； 2、算子内，无多个数据加载或者单次执行完成无Tiling切分，该场景下无法使能multi buffer； 3、multi buffer需要额外增加UB空间的使用，计算过程中UB空间不足，无法使能multi buffer；"
msgstr "When Triton operators execute on NPU, to improve performance, the NPU underlying layer provides parallel mechanisms such as multi-buffer and instruction parallelism, which parallelize \"data loading / data computation / data unloading\" to enhance performance. However, in certain scenarios, multi-buffer cannot be enabled, affecting parallelism and leading to reduced operator execution performance. During performance optimization, if such issues exist, refer to the following points for troubleshooting and optimize according to the code examples: 1. There is a data dependency between data movement and computation, causing synchronization; MTE movement can only be triggered after Vector operations are completed, resulting in low parallelism. 2. Within the operator, there are no multiple data loads, or a single execution completes without Tiling partitioning; in such scenarios, multi-buffer cannot be enabled. 3. Multi-buffer requires additional UB space usage; if UB space is insufficient during computation, multi-buffer cannot be enabled."

msgid "<br />\\n"
msgstr "<br />"

